        <br>
        <br>
        2x16MB SIMM's for Cisco Network Processing Engines.<br>
        <br>
        The memory architecture of NPE-100, NPE-150 and NPE-200 supports DRAM 
        SIMM's. Up to 128MB can be installed while 32MB is the default option.<br>
        <br>
        The Network Processing Engines perform and maintain system management 
        operations on Cisco 7200 series of routers. This includes dealing with 
        routing protocol updates and storing of tables and many other network 
        accounting applications. <br>
        <br>
        </font></p>
